Osmocom and its contributors developed libosmocore, libosmo-netif,
libosmo-abis, libosmo-sigtran, OsmoTRX, OsmoBTS, OsmoBSC, OsmoMGW,
OsmoHLR, OsmoMSC, OsmoPCU, OsmoSGSN and OsmoGGSN. libsmpp34 and the
OpenGGSN code incorporated into OsmoGGSN have their own upstream contributors.
https://osmocom.org/

Andrei Gosman developed the macOS ARM64 ports and SCTP compatibility layer
used by this recipe. Full source URLs and commits are in sources.lock.json.
https://github.com/AndreiGosman

